{"metadata":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task","title":"Events: Occurrence and Delivery Contract","kind":"task","version":"0.1.0","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T00:00:30.171Z","description":"Implement graph-native Event declarations, Occurrences, Subscriptions, Deliveries, and handler reactions in a bounded first slice."},"nodes":[{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-declaration","type":"declaration","label":"Events: Occurrence and Delivery Contract","position":{"x":-1050,"y":-650},"width":430,"height":300,"visible":false,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"analytics":{"contentGroup":"tasks"},"identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task","name":"Events: Occurrence and Delivery Contract","version":"0.1.0","description":"Implement graph-native Event declarations, Occurrences, Subscriptions, Deliveries, and handler reactions in a bounded first slice."},"intent":{"kind":"task","scope":"public"},"summaryNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary","declaration":{"kind":"task","targetMode":"artifact","defaultSurfaceId":"root","surfaces":[{"id":"root","kind":"port","label":"Events Implementation","portNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-root-port","viewNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-root-port","memo":"Safe default entry port for the graph.","exposes":{"views":{"mode":"allow"},"declarations":{"mode":"allow"}}},{"id":"summary","kind":"port","label":"Events Implementation Summary","portNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary-port","viewNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary-port","memo":"Task-shaped outward summary for collections and workboards.","exposes":{"views":{"mode":"allow"},"declarations":{"mode":"allow"}}}],"notes":["An Event is a declaration; an Occurrence records one happening with its own identity and actual payload.","One Occurrence may produce independent Deliveries through explicit Subscriptions; delivery failure does not undo the occurrence.","A graph may subscribe to Events from its immediate bridged neighbors by semantic nodeId, subject to bridge exposure. The emitting graphId remains provenance. Bridged transport preserves the occurrenceId.","Default delivery visits matching Subscriptions in graph-array order, one attempt at a time. Nested emissions queue after the current occurrence. Failed deliveries do not stop sibling deliveries; there is no automatic retry.","Event or delivery logging and persistence are authoring choices, not a default delivery obligation.","The source export bridge lists available Events; the receiving import bridge lists those exposed Events and lets an author create an explicit Subscription to a selected Handler.","A checkbox without a Handler creates an incomplete Subscription that cannot receive Deliveries.","Each root causal chain permits at most 32 descendant Occurrences in the first runtime slice. Exceeding the budget stops that chain with an observable limit outcome."]},"dependencies":{"nodeTypes":["declaration","port","summary","goal","task","decision","open-question","risk","acceptance-criteria","bridge","script"],"portContracts":["core"],"skills":["twilite-planning-graphs"],"schemaVersions":{"nodes":">=1.0.0","ports":">=1.0.0"},"optional":[]},"authority":{"mutation":{"allowCreate":true,"allowUpdate":true,"allowDelete":true,"appendOnly":false},"actors":{"humans":true,"agents":true,"tools":true},"styleAuthority":"descriptive","history":{"rewriteAllowed":false,"squashAllowed":false}},"settings":{"defaultNodeColor":"#2563eb","defaultEdgeColor":"#64748b","snapToGrid":false,"gridSize":20,"edgeRouting":"auto"},"document":{"url":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/tasks/events-occurrence-delivery/root.node"}}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-root-port","type":"port","label":"Events Implementation","position":{"x":250,"y":-920},"width":460,"height":300,"visible":false,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task","portId":"root","name":"Events Implementation"},"sourceNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary","sourcePayload":"node.web","targetNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary","dataType":"task","renderedNodeType":"task","view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web","nodeType":"task","label":"Events Implementation","surfaceId":"root"},"payload":"node.web","intent":"node","viewRole":"summary","semanticLevel":"summary","visibilityRole":"browser","presentation":{"detail":{"mode":"own","viewNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary"},"summary":{"mode":"own","viewNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary"},"icon":{"mode":"own","viewNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary"},"glyph":{"mode":"own","viewNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary"}}}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary-port","type":"port","label":"Events Implementation Summary","position":{"x":790,"y":-730},"width":460,"height":300,"visible":false,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task","portId":"summary","name":"Events Implementation Summary"},"sourceScope":"graph","authority":"consume-view","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/tasks/events-occurrence-delivery/root.node","sourceNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary","sourcePayload":"node.web","targetNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary","dataType":"task","renderedNodeType":"task","view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web","nodeType":"task","label":"Events Implementation Summary","surfaceId":"summary"},"payload":"node.web","intent":"node","viewRole":"summary","semanticLevel":"summary","visibilityRole":"browser","presentation":{"detail":{"mode":"own","viewNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary"},"summary":{"mode":"own","viewNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary"},"icon":{"mode":"own","viewNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary"},"glyph":{"mode":"own","viewNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary"}}}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary","type":"summary","label":"Implement Events as declarations with traceable occurrences and independent deliveries","position":{"x":250,"y":-730},"width":520,"height":360,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"task","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"task","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"goal":"Implement Events as declarations with traceable occurrences and independent deliveries","status":"in-progress","priority":"high","owner":"Michael","health":"on-track","nextAction":"Revise the Events topic contract, connect Handler reactions to Method Invocation authority, and complete the live browser smoke test.","blockedReason":"","taskProgress":{"completed":5,"total":8},"questionProgress":{"answered":3,"total":3},"taskTitles":["Revise the Events topic contract","Author Event and Subscription graph contracts","Define Occurrence and Delivery records","Implement emission validation and identity","Resolve explicit Subscriptions","Dispatch Deliveries with isolated outcomes","Connect Handlers to Method Invocations and traces","Smoke-test occurrence and delivery cases"],"questionTitles":["Who chooses whether Occurrences and Deliveries are logged?","How is a runaway event chain bounded?","How does a neighbor opt in to an exposed Event?"],"taskListText":"1. Revise the Events topic contract\n2. Author Event and Subscription graph contracts\n3. Define Occurrence and Delivery records\n4. Implement emission validation and identity\n5. Resolve explicit Subscriptions\n6. Dispatch Deliveries with isolated outcomes\n7. Connect Handlers to Method Invocations and traces\n8. Smoke-test occurrence and delivery cases","questionListText":"1. Who chooses whether Occurrences and Deliveries are logged?\n2. How is a runaway event chain bounded?\n3. How does a neighbor opt in to an exposed Event?","summarySource":"node-updater","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T00:00:30.171Z","title":"Implement Events as declarations with traceable occurrences and independent deliveries","body":"Goal: Implement Events as declarations with traceable occurrences and independent deliveries\nStatus: in-progress\n\nCompleted runtime slice: Event declarations, bridge exposure, explicit Subscriptions, validated Occurrences, ordered isolated Deliveries, Script Handlers, nested queueing, and the 32-descendant causal budget.\n\nRemaining: Events topic reconciliation, Handler-to-Method authority/traces, live browser smoke testing, and unopened-neighbor execution.","acceptanceCriteria":["Review the graph-owned task summary for current scope and progress"],"presentation":{"glyph":{"kind":"icon","name":"Checklist"}}}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-goal","type":"goal","label":"Implement Events as declarations with traceable occurrences and independent deliveries","position":{"x":250,"y":-250},"width":520,"height":280,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"goal","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/goal.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/goal.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"goal","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"body":"Define and implement a bounded Events slice: Event declarations validate payloads; emissions create uniquely identified Occurrences with source and cause; explicit Subscriptions resolve independent Deliveries; Handlers may request Methods only through separate authorized Invocations. Leave durability and advanced scheduling as explicit policy decisions.","owner":"Michael","priority":"high","status":"in-progress","successMetrics":["Event definition, Occurrence, Subscription, Delivery, Handler, and Method Invocation are distinct.","One emission creates one occurrence and zero or more independently tracked deliveries.","Payload contract differs from actual payload; source differs from cause.","A failed delivery does not change the occurrence or another delivery."]}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-decision-explicit-ref","type":"decision","label":"Event declaration is distinct from Occurrence","position":{"x":-380,"y":-250},"width":500,"height":250,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"decision","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/decision.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/decision.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"decision","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"status":"decided","owner":"Michael","decidedAt":"2026-09-18","rationale":"Stable runtime identity supports traceability and deduplication without requiring persistence.","body":"An Event declares what can happen and its payload/source contract. Each emission creates an Occurrence with its own ID, actual payload, source, cause, time, and correlation context."}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-decision-context-only","type":"decision","label":"Occurrence is distinct from Delivery","position":{"x":880,"y":-250},"width":500,"height":250,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"decision","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/decision.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/decision.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"decision","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"status":"decided","owner":"Michael","decidedAt":"2026-09-18","rationale":"The occurrence is a fact; delivery and reaction are subsequent work with independent outcomes.","body":"One Occurrence may match multiple explicit Subscriptions and produce a separate Delivery outcome per subscriber. A failed Delivery does not erase or rewrite the Occurrence. A Handler may request a Method through a separate Invocation."}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-risk-injection","type":"risk","label":"Feedback loops and duplicate delivery","position":{"x":-380,"y":80},"width":500,"height":260,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"risk","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/risk.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/risk.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"risk","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"status":"open","owner":"Michael","severity":"high","likelihood":"medium","body":"Handler reactions may emit more events or repeat delivery, creating cycles, duplicate effects, or misleading traces.","mitigation":"Carry occurrence and causation IDs, isolate each delivery outcome, bound the first dispatcher, and test a handler that emits another event."}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-acceptance","type":"acceptance-criteria","label":"Occurrences and deliveries are inspectable","position":{"x":880,"y":80},"width":500,"height":290,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"acceptance-criteria","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/acceptance-criteria.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/acceptance-criteria.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"acceptance-criteria","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"status":"in-progress","owner":"Michael","criteria":["An Event declaration specifies identity, payload contract, source semantics, visibility, and relevant policy.","Every emission creates one occurrence ID with actual payload, source, cause, time, and correlation fields.","Explicit graph Subscriptions yield independent Deliveries; filter, failure, and zero-subscriber cases are distinguishable.","A Handler-triggered Method request creates a separate authorized Invocation and outcome.","The first slice preserves future durability, ordering, retry, and replay choices rather than silently claiming them."],"evidence":["Runtime commit ad69e9ef","31 focused Event, bridge, and workspace tests pass","Production build passes"],"remaining":["Live browser interaction and save smoke test","Handler-to-Method Invocation authority and trace proof","Execution against unopened bridged neighbors"]}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-task-contract","type":"task","label":"Revise the Events topic contract","position":{"x":-380,"y":470},"width":460,"height":250,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"task","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"task","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"title":"Revise the Events topic contract","body":"Replace the Event-as-occurrence definition with Event declaration, Occurrence, Subscription, Delivery, Handler, and optional Method Invocation. Capture source/cause and payload contract/actual payload separately.","status":"in-progress","priority":"high","owner":"Michael","acceptanceCriteria":["The Events topic graph states the revised semantics and preserves unresolved delivery policies."],"estimateHours":"","nextAction":"Revise the Events topic graph to match the implemented bridge exposure and delivery contract."}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-task-discovery","type":"task","label":"Author Event and Subscription graph contracts","position":{"x":130,"y":470},"width":460,"height":250,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"task","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"task","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"title":"Author Event and Subscription graph contracts","body":"Author Event declaration and Subscription graph contracts. Add an Events checklist to the source export bridge and a receiving-side exposed-Events checklist to the immediate neighbor import bridge. Checking an Event creates an explicit Subscription by semantic nodeId and Event key; selecting a Handler completes it. An unbound Subscription is visible but inactive.","status":"done","priority":"medium","owner":"Michael","acceptanceCriteria":["Source owners choose Events to expose; neighbors can opt in only to exposed Events; the checked state is backed by an inspectable Subscription node or edge, not an invisible callback.","An unbound Subscription is visibly incomplete and receives nothing."],"estimateHours":"","completedAt":"2026-09-19T00:00:30.171Z","implementationEvidence":{"runtimeCommit":"ad69e9ef","validation":"31 focused Event/bridge/workspace tests and production build passed"}}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-task-trust","type":"task","label":"Define Occurrence and Delivery records","position":{"x":640,"y":470},"width":460,"height":250,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"task","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"task","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"title":"Define Occurrence and Delivery records","body":"Give each Occurrence an ID, event ref, actual source, cause, payload, time, and correlation data. Give each Delivery its own subscription target, status, and outcome.","status":"done","priority":"high","owner":"Michael","acceptanceCriteria":["One occurrence can represent several deliveries without conflating their identities or persistence."],"estimateHours":"","completedAt":"2026-09-19T00:00:30.171Z","implementationEvidence":{"runtimeCommit":"ad69e9ef","validation":"31 focused Event/bridge/workspace tests and production build passed"}}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-task-context","type":"task","label":"Implement emission validation and identity","position":{"x":1150,"y":470},"width":460,"height":250,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"task","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"task","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"title":"Implement emission validation and identity","body":"Validate an emission against its Event payload/source contract, capture the actual payload and context, and create one Occurrence per accepted emission.","status":"done","priority":"high","owner":"Michael","acceptanceCriteria":["Invalid emissions are rejected visibly; valid emissions have stable identity and separate source/cause."],"estimateHours":"","completedAt":"2026-09-19T00:00:30.171Z","implementationEvidence":{"runtimeCommit":"ad69e9ef","validation":"31 focused Event/bridge/workspace tests and production build passed"}}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-task-ui","type":"task","label":"Resolve explicit Subscriptions","position":{"x":1150,"y":820},"width":460,"height":250,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"task","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"task","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"title":"Resolve explicit Subscriptions","body":"Resolve graph-authored Subscriptions only for exposed Events on immediate bridged neighbors, addressed by semantic nodeId and Event key. Preserve occurrenceId across a bridge and create one Delivery per bound match. Never forward automatically to a second neighbor.","status":"done","priority":"high","owner":"Michael","acceptanceCriteria":["A checked, Handler-bound neighbor Event delivers once; an unchecked or unbound entry does not. No implicit second hop occurs."],"estimateHours":"","completedAt":"2026-09-19T00:00:30.171Z","implementationEvidence":{"runtimeCommit":"ad69e9ef","validation":"31 focused Event/bridge/workspace tests and production build passed"}}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-task-cache","type":"task","label":"Dispatch Deliveries with isolated outcomes","position":{"x":640,"y":820},"width":460,"height":250,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"task","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"task","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"title":"Dispatch Deliveries with isolated outcomes","body":"Deliver matching Subscriptions sequentially in graph-array order, one attempt each. Queue nested emissions until the current occurrence finishes. Continue after a subscriber failure without automatic retry or required durable log. Limit each root causal chain to 32 descendant Occurrences; report a visible limit outcome when exhausted.","status":"done","priority":"medium","owner":"Michael","acceptanceCriteria":["Sibling deliveries continue after failure; nested emissions wait; no automatic retry occurs; a 33rd descendant is rejected with an observable limit outcome."],"estimateHours":"","completedAt":"2026-09-19T00:00:30.171Z","implementationEvidence":{"runtimeCommit":"ad69e9ef","validation":"31 focused Event/bridge/workspace tests and production build passed"}}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-task-authority-test","type":"task","label":"Connect Handlers to Method Invocations and traces","position":{"x":130,"y":820},"width":460,"height":250,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"task","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"task","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"title":"Connect Handlers to Method Invocations and traces","body":"Allow a Handler reaction to request a Method only through the separate invocation and authority contract; record causation/correlation links across reactions.","status":"todo","priority":"high","owner":"Michael","acceptanceCriteria":["An event never silently becomes a command, and a trace can answer why a later occurrence happened."],"estimateHours":"","nextAction":"Connect Handler reactions to the separate Method Invocation authority and trace contract."}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-task-smoke","type":"task","label":"Smoke-test occurrence and delivery cases","position":{"x":-380,"y":820},"width":460,"height":250,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"task","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"task","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"title":"Smoke-test occurrence and delivery cases","body":"Smoke-test zero, one, and multiple subscribers; source export and receiver opt-in checklists; inactive unbound Subscriptions; immediate bridge only; stable occurrenceId across the bridge; ordered one-at-a-time Delivery; nested emission queueing; no automatic retry; invalid payload; source versus cause; handler failure; a Handler requesting a Method; and the 32-descendant causal budget.","status":"in-progress","priority":"medium","owner":"Michael","acceptanceCriteria":["Tests prove one occurrence to many deliveries, failure isolation, and separate Method authority."],"estimateHours":"","nextAction":"Run the live browser smoke test and add coverage for zero subscribers, invalid payloads, and Handler-to-Method invocation."}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-question-activation","type":"open-question","label":"Who chooses whether Occurrences and Deliveries are logged?","position":{"x":-380,"y":1130},"width":500,"height":260,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"open-question","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/open-question.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/open-question.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"open-question","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"body":"Logging and persistence are authored concerns; the delivery runtime does not require a durable occurrence or delivery record. Runtime identity and outcomes remain available for the active dispatch.","status":"answered","owner":"Michael","prominence":"high","resolutionPath":"Capture as Event/Subscription authoring policy; keep dispatch independent from storage.","answer":"The author explicitly chooses logging or persistence. Default delivery is not a durable queue or event log."}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-question-trust","type":"open-question","label":"How is a runaway event chain bounded?","position":{"x":250,"y":1130},"width":500,"height":260,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"open-question","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/open-question.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/open-question.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"open-question","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"body":"Bound each root causal chain to 32 descendant Occurrences. Queue nested emissions and stop the chain visibly on the next emission.","status":"answered","owner":"Michael","prominence":"high","resolutionPath":"Implement a per-root-causation dispatch budget and visible limit outcome.","answer":"A root causal chain has a budget of 32 descendant Occurrences; exhaustion produces an observable limit outcome."}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-question-cache","type":"open-question","label":"How does a neighbor opt in to an exposed Event?","position":{"x":880,"y":1130},"width":500,"height":260,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"_classBinding":{"key":"open-question","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/open-question.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/open-question.node-class.node"},"definitionKey":"open-question","identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"body":"The source export bridge lists Event declarations in an Events checklist. The receiving import bridge shows only exposed Events; checking one creates an explicit Subscription addressed by semantic nodeId and Event key, and the author binds a Handler.","status":"answered","owner":"Michael","prominence":"high","resolutionPath":"Implement source and receiver bridge checklists backed by graph-native Subscription structure.","answer":"Source checks what is exposed; immediate bridged neighbor checks what to subscribe to. An unbound Subscription stays inactive."}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-updater","type":"script","label":"Summary Updater","position":{"x":-1050,"y":-300},"width":420,"height":260,"visible":false,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"events-occurrence-delivery-task"},"scriptName":"Events Occurrence and Delivery Summary Updater","summaryNodeId":"events-occurrence-delivery-summary","autoRun":true,"autoRunOnGraphChange":false,"autoRunOnLoad":true,"allowMutations":true,"dryRun":false,"source":"const SUMMARY='events-occurrence-delivery-summary';const DONE=new Set(['done','complete','completed','closed']);const ANSWERED=new Set(['answered','resolved','done','closed']);const norm=v=>String(v||'').trim().toLowerCase();const nodes=await api.getNodes();const summary=nodes.find(n=>n.id===SUMMARY);const goal=nodes.find(n=>n.type==='goal');const tasks=nodes.filter(n=>n.type==='task');const questions=nodes.filter(n=>n.type==='open-question');if(!summary)return{success:false,error:'Summary node missing'};const completed=tasks.filter(n=>DONE.has(norm(n.data?.status))).length;const answered=questions.filter(n=>ANSWERED.has(norm(n.data?.status))).length;const next={...(summary.data||{}),goal:goal?.label||summary.data?.goal||'Task graph',title:goal?.label||summary.data?.goal||'Task graph',body:'Goal: '+(goal?.label||summary.data?.goal||'Task graph')+'\\nStatus: '+(norm(goal?.data?.status)||'todo')+'\\n\\nTasks in scope:\\n'+tasks.map((n,i)=>(i+1)+'. '+(n.data?.title||n.label)).join('\\n')+'\\n\\nOpen questions:\\n'+questions.map((n,i)=>(i+1)+'. '+n.label).join('\\n'),status:norm(goal?.data?.status)||'todo',priority:goal?.data?.priority||summary.data?.priority||'medium',owner:goal?.data?.owner||summary.data?.owner||'',taskProgress:{completed,total:tasks.length},questionProgress:{answered,total:questions.length},taskTitles:tasks.map(n=>n.data?.title||n.label),questionTitles:questions.map(n=>n.label),taskListText:tasks.map((n,i)=>(i+1)+'. '+(n.data?.title||n.label)).join('\\n'),questionListText:questions.map((n,i)=>(i+1)+'. '+n.label).join('\\n'),summarySource:'node-updater',updatedAt:new Date().toISOString()};await api.updateNode(SUMMARY,{data:next});return{success:true,summary:next};"}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-bridge-goal","type":"bridge","label":"Create Goal","position":{"x":-380,"y":1510},"width":300,"height":120,"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0}],"data":{"authority":"bridge","resourceKind":"node-class","scope":"focused-graph","grants":["create"],"bridge":{"ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/goal.node-class.node","resourceKind":"node-class","scope":"focused-graph","grants":["create"]},"_bridge":{"classKey":"goal","classRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/goal.node-class.node","sourceRef":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/goal.node-class.node","kind":"node-class","targetKind":"node-class","entryPort":"root"},"target":{"mode":"bridge","kind":"node-class","resourceKind":"node-class","scope":"focused-graph","ref":"github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/goal.node-class.node","grants":["create"],"key":"goal","label":"Create Goal"}}},{"id":"events-occurrence-delivery-bridge-task","type":"bridge","label":"Create Task","position":{"x":20,"y